   "source": [
    "# Ders 3: Kayıp Fonksiyonları\n",
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "2a8b984b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from scipy.stats import norm, bernoulli\n",
    "from scipy.special import expit  # sigmoid\n",
    "\n",
    "np.random.seed(42)\n",
    "print(\"Kutuphaneler hazir.\")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1511cc75",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Maksimum Olabilirlik (Maximum Likelihood)\n",
    "\n",
    "Kitabın Ch. 5.1'indeki temel fikir:\n",
    "\n",
    "> Model parametrelerini `θ`, veriyi gözlemleme **olasılığını maksimize** edecek şekilde seç.\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\hat{\\theta} = \\arg\\max_\\theta \\prod_{i=1}^N p(y_i | \\mathbf{x}_i, \\theta)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Log alarak çarpımı toplama çeviririz:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\hat{\\theta} = \\arg\\max_\\theta \\sum_{i=1}^N \\log p(y_i | \\mathbf{x}_i, \\theta)$$\n",
    "\n",
    "**Kaybı minimize etmek = negatif log-likelihood'ı minimize etmek**\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "5c2edb61",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 1D Gaussian likelihood görselleştirmesi\n",
    "# Gözlem: y=2.5, sigma=1 sabit\n",
    "# Parametre mu'yu tarayarak likelihood hesapla\n",
    "\n",
    "y_obs = 2.5\n",
    "sigma = 1.0\n",
    "mu_range = np.linspace(-1, 6, 300)\n",
    "\n",
    "likelihood = norm.pdf(y_obs, loc=mu_range, scale=sigma)\n",
    "log_likelihood = norm.logpdf(y_obs, loc=mu_range, scale=sigma)\n",
    "nll = -log_likelihood  # Negatif log-likelihood (kayıp)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 3, figsize=(15, 4))\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[0].plot(mu_range, likelihood, 'steelblue', lw=2)\n",
    "axes[0].axvline(y_obs, color='red', linestyle='--', label=f\"y_obs={y_obs}\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"Likelihood  p(y|mu)\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_xlabel(\"mu (model parametresi)\"); axes[0].legend()\n",
    "axes[0].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[1].plot(mu_range, log_likelihood, 'darkorange', lw=2)\n",
    "axes[1].axvline(y_obs, color='red', linestyle='--', label=f\"maksimum: mu={y_obs}\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"Log-Likelihood  log p(y|mu)\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel(\"mu\"); axes[1].legend(); axes[1].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[2].plot(mu_range, nll, 'crimson', lw=2)\n",
    "axes[2].axvline(y_obs, color='red', linestyle='--', label=f\"minimum: mu={y_obs}\")\n",
    "axes[2].set_title(\"Negatif Log-Likelihood (KAYIP)\")\n",
    "axes[2].set_xlabel(\"mu\"); axes[2].legend(); axes[2].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle(\"MLE: Olabilirlik -> Log-Olabilirlik -> Kayip\", fontsize=13)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb03_mle.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "26ff2051",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Regresyon Kaybı: MSE\n",
    "\n",
    "Gauss gürültüsü varsayımı altında NLL → **Mean Squared Error (MSE)**:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$L = \\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^N (y_i - f_\\theta(x_i))^2$$\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "6e8dce83",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Farklı kayıp fonksiyonlarını karşılaştır: MSE vs MAE vs Huber\n",
    "residuals = np.linspace(-3, 3, 300)\n",
    "\n",
    "mse   = residuals**2\n",
    "mae   = np.abs(residuals)\n",
    "huber = np.where(np.abs(residuals) < 1,\n",
    "                 0.5 * residuals**2,\n",
    "                 np.abs(residuals) - 0.5)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(13, 4))\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[0].plot(residuals, mse,   'steelblue',  lw=2, label=\"MSE (L2)\")\n",
    "axes[0].plot(residuals, mae,   'darkorange', lw=2, label=\"MAE (L1)\")\n",
    "axes[0].plot(residuals, huber, 'crimson',    lw=2, label=\"Huber\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"Regresyon Kayip Fonksiyonlari\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_xlabel(\"Artik (y - y_hat)\"); axes[0].set_ylabel(\"Kayip\")\n",
    "axes[0].legend(); axes[0].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "# MSE vs aykırı değerler\n",
    "np.random.seed(5)\n",
    "x_data = np.linspace(0, 10, 50)\n",
    "y_clean = 2*x_data + 1 + np.random.randn(50)*1.5\n",
    "y_outlier = y_clean.copy()\n",
    "y_outlier[[10, 25, 40]] += np.array([15, -12, 18])  # Aykırı değerler\n",
    "\n",
    "from numpy.polynomial import polynomial as P\n",
    "x_fit = x_data.reshape(-1,1)\n",
    "coef_clean = np.polyfit(x_data, y_clean, 1)\n",
    "coef_outlier = np.polyfit(x_data, y_outlier, 1)\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[1].scatter(x_data, y_outlier, alpha=0.6, color='gray', label=\"Veri (aykiri degerlerle)\")\n",
    "axes[1].scatter(x_data[[10,25,40]], y_outlier[[10,25,40]], \n",
    "                color='red', s=80, zorder=5, label=\"Aykiri deger\")\n",
    "axes[1].plot(x_data, np.polyval(coef_clean, x_data), 'green', lw=2, label=\"Temiz veri regresyonu\")\n",
    "axes[1].plot(x_data, np.polyval(coef_outlier, x_data), 'crimson', lw=2, linestyle='--', \n",
    "             label=\"Aykiri degerli regresyon\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"MSE Aykiri Degerlere Duyarlidir!\")\n",
    "axes[1].legend(fontsize=8); axes[1].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb03_regression_loss.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "04c11479",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. İkili Sınıflandırma: Binary Cross-Entropy\n",
    "\n",
    "Bernoulli dağılımı varsayımıyla NLL → **Binary Cross-Entropy**:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$L = -\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^N \\left[ y_i \\log(\\hat{p}_i) + (1-y_i) \\log(1-\\hat{p}_i) \\right]$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Model çıktısı sigmoid ile [0,1] aralığına çekilir:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\hat{p} = \\sigma(f_\\theta(x)) = \\frac{1}{1+e^{-f_\\theta(x)}}$$\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "ec2dcaa5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Binary Cross-Entropy görselleştirmesi\n",
    "p_hat = np.linspace(0.001, 0.999, 300)\n",
    "\n",
    "bce_y1 = -np.log(p_hat)       # y=1 iken kayıp\n",
    "bce_y0 = -np.log(1 - p_hat)   # y=0 iken kayıp\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(13, 4))\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[0].plot(p_hat, bce_y1, 'steelblue', lw=2, label=\"y=1: -log(p_hat)\")\n",
    "axes[0].plot(p_hat, bce_y0, 'crimson',   lw=2, label=\"y=0: -log(1-p_hat)\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"Binary Cross-Entropy Bilesenleri\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_xlabel(\"Tahmin edilen olasilik p_hat\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_ylabel(\"Kayip\"); axes[0].set_ylim(0, 5)\n",
    "axes[0].legend(); axes[0].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Simulated sigmoid sınıflandırıcı\n",
    "np.random.seed(1)\n",
    "from sklearn.datasets import make_classification\n",
    "from sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\n",
    "\n",
    "X_cls, y_cls = make_classification(n_samples=200, n_features=2,\n",
    "                                    n_redundant=0, n_clusters_per_class=1, random_state=42)\n",
    "clf = LogisticRegression()\n",
    "clf.fit(X_cls, y_cls)\n",
    "\n",
    "xx, yy = np.meshgrid(np.linspace(X_cls[:,0].min()-0.5, X_cls[:,0].max()+0.5, 200),\n",
    "                     np.linspace(X_cls[:,1].min()-0.5, X_cls[:,1].max()+0.5, 200))\n",
    "Z = clf.predict_proba(np.c_[xx.ravel(), yy.ravel()])[:,1].reshape(xx.shape)\n",
    "\n",
    "axes[1].contourf(xx, yy, Z, levels=20, cmap='RdBu_r', alpha=0.7)\n",
    "axes[1].scatter(X_cls[:,0], X_cls[:,1], c=y_cls, cmap='RdBu_r', edgecolors='k', s=30)\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"BCE ile Logistik Siniflandirici\\n(karar siniri + olasilik haritasi)\")\n",
    "axes[1].grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb03_bce.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b665b751",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Çok Sınıflı Sınıflandırma: Softmax + Cross-Entropy\n",
    "\n",
    "K sınıf için:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\text{Softmax}(z_k) = \\frac{e^{z_k}}{\\sum_{j=1}^K e^{z_j}}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$L = -\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^N \\log \\hat{p}_{y_i,i}$$\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "8b1bc54b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def softmax(z):\n",
    "    e = np.exp(z - z.max(axis=-1, keepdims=True))  # numerik stabilite\n",
    "    return e / e.sum(axis=-1, keepdims=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "def cross_entropy(y_true_idx, probs):\n",
    "    N = len(y_true_idx)\n",
    "    return -np.mean(np.log(probs[np.arange(N), y_true_idx] + 1e-9))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Örnek: 3 sınıf, 5 örnek\n",
    "np.random.seed(3)\n",
    "logits = np.random.randn(5, 3) * 2\n",
    "probs = softmax(logits)\n",
    "y_true = np.array([0, 2, 1, 0, 2])\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Logits (ham model cikti):\")\n",
    "print(logits.round(2))\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print(\"Softmax olasiliklari (satir toplami=1):\")\n",
    "print(probs.round(3))\n",
    "print(f\"\\nSatir toplamları: {probs.sum(axis=1).round(4)}\")\n",
    "print(f\"\\nCross-Entropy Kaybi: {cross_entropy(y_true, probs):.4f}\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Görsel\n",
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 3, figsize=(15, 4))\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(3):\n",
    "    colors = ['crimson' if j == y_true[i] else 'steelblue' for j in range(3)]\n",
    "    axes[i % 3].bar(['Sinif 0','Sinif 1','Sinif 2'], probs[i], color=colors, edgecolor='white')\n",
    "    axes[i % 3].set_title(f\"Ornek {i}: Gercek sinif={y_true[i]}\")\n",
    "    axes[i % 3].set_ylabel(\"Olasilik\")\n",
    "    axes[i % 3].set_ylim(0, 1)\n",
    "    axes[i % 3].grid(axis='y', alpha=0.3)\n",
    "    axes[i % 3].set_xlabel(\"Kirmizi = dogru sinif\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.suptitle(\"Softmax Cikti Olasiliklari (3 ornek)\", fontsize=13)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb03_softmax.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "90f54099",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Kayıp Fonksiyonu Özet Tablosu\n",
    "\n",
    "| Problem | Dağılım | Kayıp Fonksiyonu |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| Regresyon | Gauss | MSE (L2) |\n",
    "| Regresyon (robust) | Laplace | MAE (L1) |\n",
    "| İkili sınıflandırma | Bernoulli | Binary Cross-Entropy |\n",
    "| Çok sınıflı | Kategorik | Softmax + Cross-Entropy |\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "1e60916c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Karşılaştırmalı özet: aynı veri için farklı kayıpların davranışı\n",
    "\n",
    "errors = np.linspace(-3, 3, 500)\n",
    "\n",
    "losses = {\n",
    "    \"MSE (L2)\": errors**2,\n",
    "    \"MAE (L1)\": np.abs(errors),\n",
    "    \"Huber (d=1)\": np.where(np.abs(errors)<1, 0.5*errors**2, np.abs(errors)-0.5),\n",
    "    \"Log-Cosh\": np.log(np.cosh(errors)),\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(10, 5))\n",
    "colors_list = ['steelblue', 'crimson', 'darkorange', 'purple']\n",
    "for (name, loss), color in zip(losses.items(), colors_list):\n",
    "    ax.plot(errors, loss, label=name, lw=2, color=color)\n",
    "\n",
    "ax.set_title(\"Kayip Fonksiyonlari Karsilastirmasi\", fontsize=14)\n",
    "ax.set_xlabel(\"Artik (y - y_hat)\"); ax.set_ylabel(\"Kayip\")\n",
    "ax.legend(fontsize=11); ax.grid(alpha=0.3)\n",
    "ax.set_ylim(0, 6)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.savefig(\"fig_nb03_all_losses.png\", dpi=100, bbox_inches='tight')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "11546e88",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Özet\n",
    "\n",
    "- **MLE prensibi**: Veriyi en iyi açıklayan parametreleri bul → NLL'i minimize et\n",
    "- **Regresyon** (Gauss): MSE kaybı — büyük hatalara duyarlı\n",
    "- **İkili sınıflandırma** (Bernoulli): BCE — sigmoid + log kaybı\n",
    "- **Çok sınıflı** (Kategorik): Softmax + Cross-Entropy\n",
    "- Kayıp seçimi **dağılım varsayımına** bağlıdır\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  }
